# Pachino Grand Prix: Capitan Pachino and friends race round the streets of Bologna.
# The engine reads every *.kart file in this folder (and the *.track files they name);
# docs/RULES.md describes every block.

game pachino-gp
    name Pachino Grand Prix
    text Capitan Pachino, the tomato pirate, has left the Garden Isle for a road race round
    text the hospital of Sant'Orsola in Bologna. His friends are with him; so are the bosses.
    # Where the client finds each kind of model (folders of web/).
    assets racers models/racers
    assets karts models/karts
    assets items models/items
    assets props models/props
    assets hazards models/karts
    field 4
    first sorsola
    credit Capitan Pachino: from Capitan Pachino 64, by its author
    credit Food, karts, racing props and trees: Kenney (kenney.nl), CC0
    credit Streets and buildings: © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL
end

# The karts' numbers. Every racer's stats (1 to 5, 3 is average) scale them.
physics
    top 30              # m/s at speed 3 (108 km/h)
    accel 14
    brake 28
    coast 0.5
    turn 2.2            # radians a second at full lock
    grip 9
    drift-grip 2.2
    drift-charge 0.7 1.5
    drift-boost 0.7 1.4
    boost-power 1.3
    offroad 0.55        # top speed off the road: on the pavement and the verges
    corner 20           # how hard the computer racers take corners, m/s²
    catchup 0.05
    basket-respawn 4
    unpack 1
    countdown 3
    time-limit 900
    pad-boost 1
    radius 1
end
